#~ msgid ""
#~ "Some things only the system itself may read, such as the firewall's "
#~ "rules. gAudit then asks for your password once and runs these checks "
#~ "together. They only read: nothing on the computer is changed. The "
#~ "administrator rights end two minutes after the last check, and never "
#~ "later than thirty minutes after you gave the password. While gAudit holds "
#~ "them, a red dot is shown in front of Audit Center."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Noe kan bare systemet selv lese, som brannmurens regler. gAudit ber da om "
#~ "passordet ditt én gang og kjører disse sjekkene sammen. De bare leser: "
#~ "ingenting på datamaskinen endres. Administratorrettighetene slutter to "
#~ "minutter etter siste sjekk, og aldri senere enn tretti minutter etter at "
#~ "du ga passordet. Mens gAudit har dem, vises en rød prikk foran "
#~ "Auditsenter."

